blocks.english:
Soon the Order called by the name of Jesus is begun;
Thereafter, confirmed under a favourable omen, it is approved.
Ignatius is commanded to preside over [the printed “Sacco” is unresolved] the company;
[The printed “Pastoris hujus mutui grex gessit subsellere” is unresolved.]
